+ * <br />
+ * This can have more than one level of hierarchy, in example:
+ * <ul>
+ * <li>When using @{@link io.quarkus.test.junit.mockito.InjectMock} or @{@link io.quarkus.test.junit.mockito.InjectSpy}</li>
